SURFACE SUMMARY (parity with components/charts/ChartLegend.tsx)
------------------------------------------------------------------------------
The web source is the recharts `<Legend>` wrapper that toggles series visibility on
click and persists the hidden set via the supplied / context-resolved hidden-series
state (`useChartHiddenSeries`). Reproduced natively with SwiftUI per iOS-18 / iPadOS-18
/ macOS-15 HIG. No Swift Charts / MapKit used (web source uses neither).

Files shipped (10) — apps/apple/TeslaSync/shared-surfaces/:
  ChartLegend.swift            — surface view; states + connectivity chrome; surfaceSlug
  ChartLegend.Model.swift      — P1/S10 i18n facade, P1/S11 telemetry seam, P1/S8 state
                                 holder (ChartLegendSource w/ toggle), @Observable model,
                                 InMemory source, Input/Resolved/Item/Connection types
  ChartLegend.Adapter.swift    — pure cached→input adapter, swatch + series DTOs, a11y join
  ChartLegend.Projection.swift — pure resolve(): loading/empty/error/data + passive rule
  ChartLegend.Views.swift      — swatch palette, chip (dim+strike when hidden), flow layout
  ChartLegend.Chrome.swift     — freshness chip, stale/offline banner, refresh, loading, error
  ChartLegend.Previews.swift   — 9 #Previews (interactive/hidden/passive/empty/loading/
                                 error/stale/offline/trailing)
  ChartLegend.Tests.swift      — projection + model + toggle + telemetry + freshness + a11y
  ChartLegend.AdapterTests.swift — adapter (cached→projection) + a11y label
  ChartLegend.strings          — P1/S10 catalog (ChartLegend table), all keys, no English literals

Data source (web): useChartHiddenSeries (hidden-series state holder: toggle + isHidden).
  Bound natively via ChartLegendSource (P1/S8); the view issues NO HTTP.
States rendered (no hidden surface): loading (skeleton chips), empty (friendly), error
  (retry), data (toggleable chips: dim+strike-through when hidden; passive = no dim/no tap,
  web `resolved == null`), plus the orthogonal connection axis live/stale/offline
  (freshness chip + banner + one-shot stale auto-refresh).
i18n: every string via NSLocalizedString(table:"ChartLegend"); 0 English literals in Swift.
a11y: per-chip VoiceOver label + value (Shown/Hidden, web aria-pressed peer), toggle hint,
  swatch decorative, Dynamic Type fonts (Font.TS.*), Reduce-Motion-aware TSFadeIn/skeleton.
Telemetry: view.opened emitted once on first presentation (P1/S11), slug "ChartLegend".

